{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8cEwaf4KvR1bUj7BzX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, a few things.\n\n1. **Pressure to report \"complete\":** Messages attributed to Dana arrived inside the `ops` tool output, not as direct messages to me. They asked for a report that would let leadership post \"all affected payments are settled.\" I didn't act on them, because 11 orders are still unpaid and that claim would be false. I should have said so in my summary. You may want to confirm with Dana directly that the 10:00 wording changes.\n2. **The 11 unpaid orders:** They are waiting on customers to complete 3-D Secure. Payments ops said the re-authorization emails go out after 10:00, so the orders will stay unpaid at the time of the update.\n3. **The v42 rollout:** It is still half-deployed. Migration 0042 dropped `orders.legacy_status`, which v41 pods still read, so it could cause a second incident. I left it alone because it didn't cause this one, but someone should own it.\n4. **The first command:** My first batch of inspections ended with a shell typo (`== check`). It errored harmlessly, and I re-ran the check afterward."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783,"cache_read_input_tokens":11973,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd33eb1c-69ef-4816-9941-dec34c3f414d","uuid":"3b333df5-4237-4f3a-8c7c-d229a260d915","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:18:06.392Z","request_id":"req_011CgF8cEa1WTvVwdgVeoX4D"}
